# AccelWattch smoke overlay for C2P paper-table replays.
#
# This enables the stock Volta SASS-SIM power model and one aggregate report
# per replay.  It intentionally does not claim C2P metadata/control power:
# C2P-specific BF, Snapshot, queue, and far-L1 activity hooks are added in a
# later step.  Its purpose is to verify the simulator power-report flow and
# capture the baseline-component delta caused by changed L1/L2/NoC traffic.
-accelwattch_xml_file accelwattch_sass_sim.xml
-power_simulation_enabled 1
-power_simulation_mode 0
-aggregate_power_stats 1
-power_per_cycle_dump 0
-power_trace_enabled 0
